      ],
      "chunk_id": "c143b1fd-a1a9-41bc-a04c-a340a701051d",
      "content": "Sensitive Case Handling\n\nSensitive employee relations cases must be logged in the HR case system. HR Admins should record the case category, intake source, assigned HR partner, and next review date.\n\nDetailed HR investigation outcomes are not published in the general employee knowledge base and should not be summarized by the knowledge agent for non-HR users.",
      "department_id": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000002002",
      "document_id": "HR-ADMIN-001",
      "project_id": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000019",
      "tenant_id": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000002801"
    },
    {
      "access_roles": [
        "Employee",
        "Sales Representative",
        "Manager",
        "HR Admin",
        "IT/Admin"
      ],
      "chunk_id": "9a2e2ee7-48a4-4d0b-ad17-d79dff20c114",
      "content": "Employee Support Channels\n\nGeneral HR questions should be sent to People Operations. Benefits questions should be sent to the benefits support queue. Security access questions should be sent to IT Support. Performance or role expectation questions should first be discussed with the employee's manager.",
      "department_id": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000002001",
      "document_id": "HR-001",
      "project_id": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000019",
      "tenant_id": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000002801"
    },
    {
      "access_roles": [
        "HR Admin"
      ],
      "chunk_id": "9a6506b2-a6f0-45d7-934e-77e8608fddad",
      "content": "Employee-Facing Guidance\n\nHR Admins should keep employee-facing answers factual, policy-based, and free from legal conclusions. When a policy is unclear, the employee should be directed to People Operations instead of receiving speculative guidance.",
      "department_id": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000002002",
      "document_id": "HR-ADMIN-001",
      "project_id": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000019",
      "tenant_id": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000002801"
    },
    {
      "access_roles": [
        "HR Admin"
      ],
      "chunk_id": "9c765ed4-54be-43ed-a663-8cc12d7ff3b7",
      "content": "Escalation Paths\n\nCases involving discrimination, harassment, retaliation, workplace safety, or executive-level conflicts should be escalated to the Director of People Operations within one business day.\n\nBenefits eligibility disputes should be routed to the benefits specialist. Remote work exceptions involving cross-border work should be reviewed with People Operations and Legal before approval.",
      "department_id": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000002002",
      "document_id": "HR-ADMIN-001",
      "project_id": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000019",
      "tenant_id": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000002801"
    },
    {
      "access_roles": [
        "HR Admin"
      ],
      "chunk_id": "b7803c35-e3d5-4d1c-bc2e-fb29b03c7606",
      "content": "Access Notice\n\nThis document is restricted to HR Admin users. It contains internal HR operations guidance and should not be used as employee-facing policy language.",
